      <title>Java设计模式（五）：适配器模式实战解析</title>
      <link>https://raphaell2e.github.io/posts/java%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F%E4%BA%94-%E9%80%82%E9%85%8D%E5%99%A8%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/</link>
